### 설정 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/preferences/1/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 설정 변경
PUT {{baseUrl}}/preferences/1/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "BLACK",
  "language": "KO"
}

### 채널 알림 설정 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/preferences/account/me/channels/{{channelId}}/notification
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 채널 알림 설정 변경
PUT {{baseUrl}}/preferences/account/me/channels/{{channelId}}/notification
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notification": false
}
